 (295,295,'Unknown','NOEL MASSEY','ALDOUS','Captain',115,'General Service Corps, S.A. Forces',340,'Unknown',0,'1942-05-10','Lost in H.M. Hospital Ship Ramb IV, which was bombed by enemy aircraft. He was presumed killed whilst being evacuated as a patient (malaria) from Tobruk to Alexandria.','Husband of Pamela Frances Aldous (nee Blackwell)','Egypt',23,'ALAMEIN MEMORIAL',35,'30.83823','28.94696 ','Column 148.',NULL,'N M','225368','','',0,'',0,''),
