 (1580,1580,'Unknown','PETER WESTMORLAND','BENNEE','Lieutenant',334,'South African Air Force',775,'5 Sqdn.',1300,'1944-09-09','Killed in action, shot down by flak 5 miles SW of Rimini, in Curtis P-40D Kittyhawk Mk IV #FX570','Son of Dr. Archibald John and Mrs. Annie Geddes Bennee, of Durban, Natal, South Africa.','Italy',39,'BEACH HEAD WAR CEMETERY, ANZIO',172,'41.48234','12.62499 ','XVIII. J. 12.',NULL,'P W','328719V','21','',0,'',0,''),
