 (2194,2194,'Unknown','FREDERIK JOHANNES','BOTES','Burgher',109,'Mounted Commandos, S.A. Forces',492,'Geyser&#39;s Commando',2174,'1914-11-08','Killed in action, west of Warmbaths','Born about 1896 Pretoria Dist. Died 8 Nov 1914. Mother Catharina Philipina STANDERS deceased. Estate MHG 12532. Coert Nicolaas GROBLER - half brother. Magdalena Maria - half sister.','South Africa',72,'ZANDFONTEIN FARM BURIAL GROUND, WATERBERG',2789,'-24.66469','27.81056 ','',NULL,'F J','','','Limpopo Province',1,'',0,''),
