 (3593,3593,'Unknown','','CHAN YUEN SHING','Carpenter',119,'Merchant Navy',474,'S.S. Columbine',2905,'1944-06-16','On 16 June 1944, the unescorted Columbine (Master Andre Reidar Simensen) was torpedoed and sunk by U-198, 25 miles northwest of Cape Columbine, South Africa. The master, 19 crew members and six passengers were lost.','Son of Chan Shen Shee, of Tinghai District, Chekiang Province, China. ref. South African Roll of Honour 1939-1945','Lost at Sea',46,'DIED AT SEA',657,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','','28','',0,'***Not yet accepted for War Grave Status by CWGC, need service file',0,''),
