 (6123,6123,'Unknown','ANDREW PETER','DU PREEZ','Lieutenant',334,'South African Air Force',775,'Unknown',0,'1947-02-11','Died in motor accident','Son of Andries Petrus du Preez and Mrs. Roux (formerly du Preez), of Middleburg, Transvaal. Husband of Hendrina Maria du Preez, of Ermelo. Born Witbank, Transvaal.','South Africa',72,'ERMELO CEMETERY',802,'-26.51972','29.97728 ','Grave 1457.',NULL,'A P','P/207199','23','Mpumalanga',1,'',0,''),
