 (6322,6322,'Unknown','RUPERT ALAN','DUROSE','Lieutenant',334,'South African Air Force',775,'1 Sqdn.',117,'1942-07-11','Killed in action, shot down in Alamein area, in Curtis P-40D Kittyhawk Mk I #ET1020. Escorted twelve Bostons on a raid south-west of El Alamein. On the way to the target, a large formation was seen, composed of 30 Ju87s escorted by seven Bf109 from I Gruppe, twelve of II Gruppe and two from III/JG 27, the Curtiss fighters being ordered to leave the Bostons and attack.','Son of Claud and Minnie C. Durose, of Merrivale, Natal, South Africa; husband of Connie Durose. 85 years of SAAF has him as 2 Sqdn.','Egypt',23,'ALAMEIN MEMORIAL',35,'30.83823','28.94696 ','Column 267.',NULL,'R A','103189','27','',0,'',0,''),
