 (8666,8666,'Unknown','EDWARD SCOTT WARING','GREEN','Second Lieutenant',475,'Middlesex Regiment',478,'1st Bn.',528,'1916-08-27','Killed in action','Son of H. E. O. and Anne Green, of Kimberley, South Africa. born 8/1/1887. Educated at St. Andrew&#39;s College, Grahamstown from 1898-1901. Served through G.S.W.A. campaign with 1st I.L.H. and later with Pretoria Regiment. Held commission as Lieutenant in 5th Battalion, Middlesex Regiment. Commemoration stone in Johannesburg (Braamfontein) Cemetery','France',27,'QUARRY CEMETERY, MONTAUBAN',2077,'50.01419','2.78133 ','VI. J. 7.',NULL,'E S W','','29','Somme',1,'',0,''),
