 (8668,8668,'Unknown','FRANK BISHOP','GREEN','Petty Officer Stoker',408,'Royal Navy',685,'H.M.S. Neptune',2332,'1941-12-19','Ran into an uncharted minefield in the Mediterranean off Tripoli, and sank with the loss of 764 officers and men.','Son of Arthur and Martha Green; husband of Lydia Janet Green, of Observatory, Cape Town, South Africa.','United Kingdom',90,'PLYMOUTH NAVAL MEMORIAL',1989,'50.36573','-4.14223 ','Panel 51, Column 3.',NULL,'F B','D/KX 81357','33','Devon',2,'',0,''),
