 (9491,9491,'Unknown','JOHN HEREWARD TITLEY','HAWORTH','Flying Officer',259,'Royal Air Force Volunteer Reserve',638,'44 Sqdn.',1207,'1944-11-01','Died in Aircraft Accident, took off 1342 from Spilsby to attack the Meerbeck synthetic oil plant. Hit by Flak over the target which badly damaged the Lancaster and killed F/O Haworth','Of Southern Rhodesia.','United Kingdom',90,'MAIDSTONE CEMETERY, Kent',1570,'51.25574','0.53259 ','Plot C.C.1. Grave 87.',NULL,'J H T','160208','','Kent',1,'',0,''),
