 (12280,12280,'Unknown','PETER ROOKE','KINGSTON','Lieutenant',334,'South African Artillery',784,'Unknown',0,'1944-02-16','Killed in action','Son of Charles B. and Janet B. Kingston, of Forest Row, Sussex. B.A. (Cantab.). Born in London. He migrated to Johannesburg in 1924. Returned back to the UK to study at Oundle School and Cambridge University (Clare College), before going to McGill University in Canada 1935-1937.','Italy',39,'CASSINO WAR CEMETERY',482,'41.47757','13.82728 ','II. G. 23.',NULL,'P R','329768V','29','',0,'',582,'seconded to 31 Field Regt. Royal Artillery'),
