 (13211,13211,'Unknown','JAMES McCALLUM','LEE','Corporal',166,'South African Tank Corps',862,'7th Reconnaissance Bn.',1606,'1944-11-12','Died in blizzard, after escaping from Italian Prisoner of War camp. Captured at Tobruk','Son of Michael and Janet McCallum Lee, of 50 Devenish Street, Sunnyside, Pretoria. His brothers Douglas Melville Lee and Robert McCallum Lee also died in service during WW2.','Egypt',23,'ALAMEIN MEMORIAL',35,'30.83823','28.94696 ','Column 136.',NULL,'J M','213969','37','',0,'',0,''),
