 (16123,16123,'Unknown','ANGUS BEATTY','McLAGGAN','Gunner',278,'South African Artillery',784,'Unknown',0,'1941-10-01','Killed in Durban as a result of an accident in a military lorry','Son of Donald G. McLaggan and Iris E. McLaggan; husband of Lilian M. McLaggan, of Durban. He was born on October 25th, 1919, and entered Milner House in January 1935, and left Plumtree in the same year. On Plumtree School Roll of Honour','South Africa',72,'MIDDELBURG (WEST) CEMETERY',1666,'-25.764','29.44846 ','E.C. Plot. Grave 1957.',NULL,'A B','124295','21','Mpumalanga',1,'',0,''),
