 (17749,17749,'Unknown','CHRISTIAN JOHANNES','MOUTON','Lieutenant',334,'South African Air Force',775,'60 Sqdn.',1426,'1944-08-26','Killed in action, Airborne 08:00 on 26 Aug 1944 from San Severo on a photo reconnaissance (PR) mission to several Messerschmitt aircraft factories and airfields at Regensburg. The aircraft was intercepted by a Me 262 (Ofw. Helmut Recker of Erprobungskommando 262) and crashed 10:19Z 3 km S of Breitenhill, 22 km N of Ingolstadt.','Husband of Johanna C. Mouton, of Bulawayo, Southern Rhodesia.','Germany',29,'DURNBACH WAR CEMETERY',737,'47.77834','11.73354 ','2. A. 20.',NULL,'C J','100473V','30','Bad Tolz, Bayern',1,'',0,''),
