 (19374,19374,'Unknown','ROBERT DUNCAN','OLVER','Sergeant',492,'Royal Air Force Volunteer Reserve',638,'44 Sqdn.',1207,'1942-05-09','Killed in action, in Avro Lancaster R5568, aircraft was lost near Lambrechtshagen, 7 km WNW of Rostock. The wreckage was found close to Lancaster I R5555 which suggests the aircraft may have collided.','Of Bulawayo. On St. George&#39;s College War Memorial, Harare, Zimbabwe. RAF Number: Enlistments in Rhodesia','Germany',29,'BERLIN 1939-1945 WAR CEMETERY',231,NULL,NULL,'8. A. 7.',NULL,'R D','777613','','Berlin, Berlin',1,'',0,''),
