 (19503,19503,'Unknown','GLENDOWER GEORGE','OTTLEY','Major',343,'Royal Fusiliers',662,'Unknown',0,'1916-09-03','Killed in action','Son of Richard and Fanny Ottley; husband of Florence Mary Ottley, of Clanconnel, Catisfield, Fareham, Hants. Served in the Tirah Campaign, on the Punjab Frontier, 1897-8, and in the South African War. Commemoration stone in Niton St John&#39;s Church Cemetery, Isle of Wight. ref. South African Roll of Honour 1914-1918','France',27,'THIEPVAL MEMORIAL',2498,'50.05081','2.68569 ','Pier and Face 8 C 9 A and 16 A.',NULL,'G G','','44','Somme',417,'',417,'attd. 9th Bn. East Surrey Regiment'),
