 (21323,21323,'Unknown','GEORGE GODFREY','RENNIE','Able Seaman',25,'Royal Naval Volunteer Reserve (South Africa)',684,'S.A.R.N.V.R.  H.M.S. "Pembroke"',2851,'1918-11-04','Died of influenza','Son of Mr. James and Frances Ann Rennie, of 52, St. Saviours Rd., St. Helier, Jersey, formerly of Durban','United Kingdom',90,'GILLINGHAM (WOODLANDS) CEMETERY',941,NULL,NULL,'Naval. 5. 252.',NULL,'G G','F/1123/121','23','Kent',1,'',0,''),
