 (21683,21683,'Unknown','KENDRICK','ROBINSON','Lieutenant',334,'South African Air Force',775,'40 Sqdn.',1162,'1943-07-12','Killed in action, in Supermarine Spitfire, bounced by three Re.2005s of 362a Squadriglia while patrolling over Lentini - Pozzallo, Sicily. Killed by Capitano Giulio Torresi (who claimed him as his 9th victory)','Son of Joseph Benjamin and Beatrix Emily Robinson, of Germiston, Transvaal, South Africa. Commemoration stone in Germiston (Primrose) Cemetery, Gauteng','Egypt',23,'ALAMEIN MEMORIAL',35,'30.83823','28.94696 ','Column 278.',NULL,'K','206657V','23','',0,'',0,''),
