 (22045,22045,'Unknown','CECIL ALBERT','RUMNEY','Sapper',469,'South African Engineer Corps',797,'Unknown',0,'1941-03-08','Killed in action','Son of Charles Siegmund and Maria Sophia Carolina (nee Halling) Rumney. Husband of Olive Mary (nee Dyer) Rumney. Was an accomplished amateur soccer player, and he played for the South African Railways Soccer Team. Born Johannesburg. A fireman on Railway','Kenya',41,'NAIROBI WAR CEMETERY',1756,'-1.30902','36.74788 ','2. B. 13.',NULL,'C A','190413','33','',0,'',0,''),
