 (22077,22077,'Unknown','JOHN JAMES FRASER','RUSSELL','Captain',115,'South African Medical Corps',817,'15 Field Amb.',376,'1941-12-02','Killed in action, in Libya','Son of Sir Alexander Fraser Russell and Lady Winifred Isobel Russell, of Cape Town, South Africa; husband of Sheila Anne Graham Russell, of Cape Town. B.A. (Cantab.), Ch.B. (Edin.). Entered Plumtree School in January 1916, leaving in April 1918. He entered the University of Cape Town in 1926; later he qualified as Doctor from the University of Cambridge. On Plumtree School Roll of Honour','Egypt',23,'HALFAYA SOLLUM WAR CEMETERY',1044,'31.54956','25.16047 ','24. B. 2.',NULL,'J J F','188358','34','',0,'',0,''),
