 (22325,22325,'Unknown','COLIN CAMPBELL','SAWYER','Lance Corporal',311,'Imperial Light Horse, S.A. Forces',392,'1st',515,'1942-06-07','Killed in action, in a Composite Coy attack on positions to the front which began at 0400. However, heavy enemy fire and mounting casualties resulted in the Coy being withdrawn under a smoke screen supplied by the Artillery. The Regiment was holding positions at Gazala, at the time','Son of Colin Campbell and Jessie Hamilton Sawyer, of 34 Hathorn Avenue, Sydenham, Johannesburg. Husband of Violet Margaret Sawyer, of 42, Forest St, Forest Hills, Johannesburg. Born Boksburg, Transvaal. A salesman. They had no children.','Libya',45,'KNIGHTSBRIDGE WAR CEMETERY, ACROMA',1344,'32.09586','23.71913 ','5. C. 17.',NULL,'C C','31308','29','',0,'',0,''),
