 (28020,28020,'Unknown','ARCHIBALD FRANCIS','WELDON','Sergeant',492,'South African Reserve Mechanical Transport',850,'Unknown',0,'1942-12-19','Died in Aircraft Accident, in Lockheed Lodestar 18-08 #248. Crashed into the sea shortly after takeoff from Kisumu Airport (KIS). The airplane came down in Kavirondo Gulf, Lake Victoria. It appeared that the undercarriage could not be raised after takeoff because of an electrical failure in the under-carriage safety lock circuit. The Lodestar was returning to South Africa from Cairo, Egypt','Son of John Francis Weldon and Annie Madeline Phelan; husband of May Melinda Weldon, of Johannesburg','South Africa',72,'THABA TSHWANE (OLD No.1) MILITARY CEMETERY',2491,'-25.80165','28.12721 ','L. 10.',NULL,'A F','55780','33','Gauteng',1,'',0,''),
