 (29002,29003,'Unknown','','YEN SIN WON','Galley Boy',269,'Merchant Navy',474,'S.S. Columbine',2905,'1944-06-16','On 16 June 1944, the unescorted Columbine (Master Andre Reidar Simensen) was torpedoed and sunk by U-198, 25 miles northwest of Cape Columbine, South Africa. The master, 19 crew members and six passengers were lost.','ref. South African Roll of Honour 1939-1945','Lost at Sea',46,'DIED AT SEA',657,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','','27','',0,'***Not yet accepted for War Grave Status by CWGC, need service file',0,''),
