 (29228,29231,'Unknown','DANIE','ANDERSON','Trooper',581,'1 Special Service Battalion',14,'Fauresmith',2136,'1975-12-17','Died in Military Vehicle Accident, while on Op Savannah. He was in the turret of an Eland armoured car, about 100km south of Luanda, when the brakes failed on a downhill, causing the vehicle to run away and overturn. He was thrown from the vehicle and died of a broken neck.','Son of Dr. and Mrs. F. Anderson, of Pretoria.','South Africa',72,'PAARL (PARYS) CEMETERY',1904,'-33.74115','18.9772 ','Special Memorial',NULL,'D','72477714BA','19','Western Cape',1,'',0,''),
