 (29305,29308,'Unknown','RUDOLF JOHANNES','BADENHORST','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'Regiment De la Rey',2806,'1987-09-26','Died in Military Vehicle Accident near Mooi Plaas in the Kruger National Park. He was busy with a compulsory camp and crashed the vehicle at night, on a unauthorized trip.','Husband of Mrs. C. E. Badenhorst, of Stilfontein.','South Africa',72,'KLERKSDORP (NEW) CEMETERY',1337,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'R J','84399393','20','North West Province',1,'',0,''),
