 (29403,29406,'Unknown','YEHEZKEL','BERLOWITZ','Private',429,'Israeli Defence Forces',410,'Infantry',2462,'1948-05-12','Killed in action, in the defense of Israel','Born at Johannesburg. Immigrated 1944. Son of Feige and Nathan. Hebrew d.o.b. would later become Independence day. Killed one day before the founding of Israel, one day before his 30th birthday according to the Hebrew date.','Israel',38,'MT. HERZL MILITARY CEMETERY',1731,NULL,NULL,'Area 1 Block 18 Row 12 Grave 39',NULL,'Y','172303','30','Jerusalem',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=90366',0,''),
