 (29437,29440,'Unknown','NORMAN','BIDEN','Lieutenant',334,'South African Air Force',775,'2 Sqdn.',657,'1951-09-05','Killed in action, in North American F-51 Mustang #302. Lt N.Biden was a member of a flight detailed to attack an artillery position in the &#39;Punchbowl&#39; area. His aircraft failed to pull out of it&#39;s dive during the napalm attack, and crashed into the ground and burst into flames.','Husband of Mrs. M. B. Biden, of Dunnottar. ref. 85 years of SAAF','South Korea',73,'UNITED NATIONS PUSAN MEMORIAL',2571,NULL,NULL,'Panel 13',NULL,'N','P1/29531','28','Gauteng',179,'Unknown',179,'Army'),
