 (29654,29657,'Unknown','BRETT','BURMEISTER','Captain',115,'South African Air Force',775,'85 Combat Flying School',1651,'2002-04-26','Killed in aircraft accident, crashed into a hill during a low-level tactical navigation exercise in the Northern Province. Went down about five kilometres east of the Albasini Dam between Louis Trichardt and Messina., in Atlas MB326KM Impala Mk II #1068','Capt. Brett Burmeister (25 or 28) of 85 Combat Flying School, AFB Hoedspruit. He had been in the SAAF for 5 years and was an instructor. His parents lived in Roodepoort.','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'B','70434790KT','33','Gauteng',118,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=90271',118,'Air Force'),
