nd our own Medical Permanent Force officers for covering up on the fact that the patrol leaders had messed up, and we had to send out a ward medic on patrol as the specially trained Ops medics were all based in other military camps in Sector 70 operating sickbays so there were no correctly trained medical personnel to go on the combat patrols.','Namibia',56,'KIMBO CEMETERY, BUFFALO',1304,NULL,NULL,'OLD SEC 99',NULL,'F','76907286SP','20','Caprivi',179,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=90271',179,'Army'),
