 (30450,30453,'Unknown','DAVID','GABRIEL','Special WO',520,'South West African Police',876,'South West Africa Police Counter-Insurgency Wing: Ops-K Division (KOEVOET)',3100,'1979-05-28','Killed in action, driving from Ondangwa to Oshakati and gave a lift to a man who, unknown to him, was a member of SWAPO/PLAN. Halfway to Oshakati Warrant Gabriel stopped alongside the road to relieve himself, leaving his FN rifle in the vehicle with the passenger. The SWAPO/PLAN passenger took the rifle and shot him dead before successfully making his escape','ref. "The Covert War" by Peter Stiff','South Africa',72,'UNKNOWN CEMETERY',2572,NULL,NULL,'Likely buried in Namibia - Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'D','76926781SP','36','Unknown',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=91788',179,'Army'),
