 (30532,30535,'Unknown','FLORIS MARTHINUS','GRIESSEL','Rifleman',462,'GROUP 34',363,'Goudveld Kommando',2179,'1983-01-06','Died of wounds, Buffel Troop Carrier detonated a boosted anti-tank mine near the Okangwati Military Base, while on route to Sodeliet base. One of the mines used was an old British Mk 8 Anti-Tank Mine and the metal plug on top of this mine penetrated the V hull of the Buffel on the welded seam. This ignited the diesel tank and a box of white phosphorus grenades in the vehicle.','Son of Hendrik Jacobus and Martha Dorothea Swanepoel Griessel. Husband of Mrs. Jean Evelyn Vermeulen Griessel, of Reitzpark, Welkom.','South Africa',72,'WELKOM CEMETERY',2694,NULL,NULL,'B30',NULL,'F M','72459506KT','27','Free State',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=511011',181,'Att 102 Battalion'),
