 (30550,30553,'Unknown','RENIER NICCOLAAS','GROBLER','Corporal',166,'South African Air Force',775,'21 Sqdn.',707,'1971-05-26','Killed in aircraft accident, flew into Devils Peak, Cape Town, whilst taking part in a rehearsal for the 1971 Republic Day celebrations, in Hawker Siddeley HS125 Mercurious #03. He was a Springbok rugby player who toured Britain in 1969/70.','Husband of Mrs. H. Grobler. ref. 85 years of SAAF','South Africa',72,'THABA TSHWANE (NEW) MILITARY CEMETERY',2490,'-25.78214','28.12179 ','Grave 691',NULL,'R N','05559893E','24','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=511011',118,'Air Force'),
