 (30557,30560,'Unknown','JOHANNES PETRUS WESSELS','GROENEWALD','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'8 South African Infantry Battalion',1628,'1987-07-30','Died of injuries, critically injured and paralysed in a landmine explosion near Katima Mulilo on 14 July 1983. He was placed into a care facility after discharge from 1 Military Hospital but three years later, complications arose as a result of these injuries and gangrene set in. He was re-admitted to 1 Military Hospital where he died','Son of Mr. S. C. Groenewald, of Alberton.','South Africa',72,'BRITS (LANGBERG) CEMETERY',355,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'J P W','81187023BG','24','North West Province',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=511011',179,'Army'),
