 (30742,30745,'Unknown','PETRUS JOHANNES JACOBUS','HOLTZHAUZEN','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'Regiment Westelike Provinsie',2816,'1977-03-25','Died in Freak Accident, at Keetmanshoop. A goods train loaded with iron ore struck a stationary troop train at the Keetmanshoop station.','Husband of Mrs. P. J. J. Holtzhausen, of Parow Valley. On Keetmanshoop Station Memorial','South Africa',72,'BELLVILLE (STIKLAND) CEMETERY',214,NULL,NULL,'D299 B',NULL,'P J J','65764292BT','27','Western Cape',1,'LG Sup 7 June 1951 pg. 3097 - "King&#39;s birthday"',179,'Army'),
