 (30764,30767,'Unknown','ANDRIES PETRUS','HUMAN','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'3 Parachute Battalion',977,'1978-05-04','Missing in Action, Ops Reindeer, raid on Cassinga, the greatest airborne raid on the continent of Africa in history','Husband of Rachel Human and father of Eugenie Human. Went missing during the initial assault jump, declared dead on 22 January 1980. It is suspected he landed in the Culonga River and drowned, weighed down by his heavy equipment. ***Update 14 April 2018, the location of his remains may have been found. https://www.news24.com/SouthAfrica/News/the-lord-answered-my-prayers-family-of-sa-paratrooper-relieved-that-his-remains-are-coming-home-after-40-years-20180414','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Body not recovered',NULL,'A P','65383390BT','29','Gauteng',1,'LG Sup 7 June 1951 pg. 3097 - "King&#39;s birthday"',118,'Air Force'),
