 (30843,30846,'Unknown','NICOLAAS FRANS','JANSEN VAN RENSBURG','Corporal',166,'South African Air Force',775,'22 Flt',736,'1971-11-25','Died in air crash. SAS President Steyn was in Luanda on a courtesy call while on a return trip from France for the acceptance of the submarine SAS Emily Hobhouse. The onboard Westland Wasp (#83) helicopter had just undergone a main rotor change and crashed while on a test flight to Luanda Airport.','Son of Mrs. J. van Rensburg','South Africa',72,'BELLVILLE (STIKLAND) CEMETERY',214,NULL,NULL,'Grave 1361',NULL,'N F','67012484E','32','Western Cape',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor83.asp?t=516019',118,'Air Force'),
