 (31197,31200,'Unknown','MARTHINUS JOHANNES','KUYLER','Trooper',581,'South West African Territory Force',877,'32 (Buffalo) Battalion',1013,'1987-09-13','Killed in action. Due to tactical circumstances, the troop got stuck in the mud of a shona near the Lomba River during a tank fight, and the Ratel 90 was destroyed at point blank by a T55 tank. The commander, 2Lt Alves, his crew as well as 32 Bn members were killed instantly. The tank round penetrated the Ratel through the side door, detonated in the main ammunition storage container and resulted in an explosion causing the vehicle to catch fire. (Operation Modular)','Son of Mr. and Mrs. I. H. Crouse','South Africa',72,'MURRAYSBURG CEMETERY',1737,NULL,NULL,'A1',NULL,'M J','83244178BG','20','Western Cape',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=516194',179,'Army'),
