 (31289,31292,'Unknown','ANDREW PATRICK','LEITH','Second Lieutenant',475,'South African Air Force',775,'44 Sqdn.',1207,'2000-04-13','Died in Military Aircraft Accident, near border of Mozambique, in Cessna 185A #729. Lt. Andrew Leith (21) of Lynnwood, Pretoria, was one of 4 people in a Cessna 185 that crashed about 56 km south of Komatipoort. The flight was a routine border patrol. Capt. Rassie Botes and Sgt. Werner Grobelaar of Kimberley, and Cpl. Lindie Marcus of AFB Hoedspruit were taken to 1 Military Hospital with serious injuries.','Son of Mr. and Mrs. I. Leith.','South Africa',72,'PRETORIA (EAST) CEMETERY',2049,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'A P','96717194PW','21','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=92341',179,'Army'),
