 (31985,31988,'Unknown','ERROL CARL','MOOLMAN','Lance Corporal',311,'Rand Light Infantry',581,'SAS Donkin',3289,'1982-03-09','Drowned, went rowing on the Cunene river in a dugout canoe. He and his friend tried to go over the weir but they were caught in the rushing water, where E Moolman went missing, suspected drowned.','No additional information known at this time','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Body not recovered',NULL,'E C','77246502BT','20','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=514791',181,'Att 102 Battalion'),
