 (32212,32215,'Unknown','JOHANNES PETRUS','NEL','Lance Corporal',311,'REGIMENT',585,'8 South African Infantry Battalion',1628,'1978-11-16','Died in Freak Accident, whilst on the border as a Radioman, he rushed to one of the radio trailers and that one trailer was not earthed properly and in the rush Johan was also barefooted, it had been raining, there was a short on the door of the trailer and as he touched it he was instantly shocked to death','Son of Daniel Jacobus and Elizabeth Magretha Botha Nel','South Africa',72,'SENEKAL OLD CEMETERY',2276,'-28.31378','27.62149 ','B4',NULL,'J P','68344761BT','26','Free State',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=98653',179,'Army'),
