 (32368,32371,'Unknown','CRAIG RUDOLPH','OLIVIER','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'Durban Light Infantry',2098,'1984-05-25','Died in Military Vehicle Accident, Buffel rolled just outside Eenhana into a stormwater run-off pit and he got trapped underneath. It took 16 fellow soldiers to "pick up" the Buffel and release him from being trapped under the wheel. Unfortunately he was under water and without oxygen for too long and succumbed','Son of Mrs. C. M. Olivier, of Woodlands, Durban.','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Cremated at Stellawood Cemetery',NULL,'C R','78571882BT','22','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=517425',179,'Army'),
 (32369,32372,'Unknown','JOHANNES GERHARDUS L','OLIVIER','Lance Corporal',311,'1 Reconnaissance Regiment',9,'Durban Light Infantry',2098,'1979-03-21','Died in Military Vehicle Accident, Buffel rolled just outside Eenhana into a stormwater run-off pit and he got trapped underneath. It took 16 fellow soldiers to "pick up" the Buffel and release him from being trapped under the wheel. Unfortunately he was under water and without oxygen for too long and succumbed','No additional information known at this time','South Africa',72,'THABA TSHWANE (NEW) MILITARY CEMETERY',2490,'-25.78214','28.12179 ','Cremated at Stellawood Cemetery',NULL,'J G L','72234123PR','22','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=517425',179,'Army'),
 (32370,32373,'Unknown','JOHN PHILLIP','OLIVIER','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'Regiment Groot Karoo',2809,'1983-05-20','Killed in action, near Mupa in South Eastern Angola during a pre-cursor operation in the area to neutralise any insurgents and trained donkeys that could be used to convey enemy supplies prior to the launch of Operation Dolfyn. The patrol was in pursuit of a SWAPO/PLAN insurgent who went to ground in a cattle kraal. John Olivier was the first to arrive at the kraal and as he kicked down the kraal wall, the insurgent opened fire with a PKM Machine Gun and shot him in the chest at point blank range, killing him instantly','Son of Mrs. E. Olivier, of Goodwood.','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'J P','74543380BT','24','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=517425',179,'Army'),
