 (32405,32408,'Unknown','NIGEL DAVID','OSBORNE','Lieutenant',334,'South African Air Force',775,'19 Sqdn.',497,'1979-09-06','Killed in action, shot down in Mozambique (at Mapai). Believed to have been carrying explosives to be used in Operation Uric and hit by a RPG7 or AAA., in Aerospatiale SA3330 Puma C #164. Also killed was the SAAF aircrew and 14 Rhodesian soldiers.','Son of Mr. and Mrs. S. J. Osborne, of Durban.','Mozambique',54,'Buried at the crash site near Mapai (Rail), Mozambique by the local population',401,NULL,NULL,'Body not recovered - crash site coordinates are: S22 06&#39; 48.2" E31 39&#39; 12.1"',NULL,'N D','74299181PS','21','Gauteng',179,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=517425',179,'Army'),
