 (32663,32666,'Unknown','DIRK WILHELMUS MARTHINUS','RETIEF','Sergeant',492,'South African Air Force',775,'19 Sqdn.',497,'1979-09-06','Killed in action, shot down in Mozambique (at Mapai). Believed to have been carrying explosives to be used in Operation Uric and hit by a RPG7 or AAA., in Aerospatiale SA3330 Puma C #164. Also killed was the SAAF aircrew and 14 Rhodesian soldiers.','Son of Mrs. L. Retief. Commemoration stone in Koster Burial Ground, NWP','Mozambique',54,'Buried at the crash site near Mapai (Rail), Mozambique by the local population',401,NULL,NULL,'Body not recovered - crash site coordinates are: S22 06&#39; 48.2" E31 39&#39; 12.1". Memorial stone in Koster Burial Ground, North West Province',NULL,'D W M','66252610PE','29','Mpumalanga',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=98188',179,'Army'),
