 (32666,32669,'Unknown','SAREL JOHANNES','REYNDERS','Corporal',166,'South African Air Force',775,'3 Sqdn.',988,'1983-12-29','Died in a Private Motorcycle Accident, in Pretoria.','Son of Mr. H. D. J. Reynders, of Pretoria.','South Africa',72,'PRETORIA (EAST) CEMETERY',2049,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'S J','78339426','21','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=98188',179,'Army'),
 (32667,32670,'Unknown','JOHANNES GERHARDUS','REYNEKE','Lance Corporal',311,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'4 South African Infantry Battalion',1150,'1982-01-19','Reyneke was stationed at Etale, 18 km from the Angolan border. Assigned to an escort detail that was to protect a Water Works JCB that had the task of repairing the water pipeline between Charlie Tower at Engela hospital and Eenhana. On the way there the JCB got stuck in the mud on several occasions. Nel and his buddy (Reyneke), got off the armoured vehicle and stayed close to the JCB with the intention of assisting it through the mud whenever it got close to getting stuck. From this point on, the going was really good, until the JCB detonated a land mine with one of it&#39;s back wheels. Reyneke was killed instantly.','No additional information known at this time','South Africa',72,'MAKOPANE (OR POTGIETERSRUST) CEMETERY',1580,'-24.17421','29.02071 ','3',NULL,'J G','78532413BG','19','Limpopo Province',383,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=98188',383,'attd. 53rd Bn. "A" Coy.'),
