 (32674,32677,'Unknown','JOSE CORREIA PINTO "CARNAVAL" "ROBBIE"','RIBEIRO','Sergeant',492,'1 Reconnaissance Regiment',9,'Protected Village Protection Group',3283,'1976-08-25','Killed while evacuating battle casualties to a hospital in South West Africa.','Robbie&#39;s brother also served with the SADF, and as Robbie was also tragically killed while doing his duty to his newly adopted country.','South Africa',72,'THABA TSHWANE (NEW) MILITARY CEMETERY',2490,'-25.78214','28.12179 ','Grave 898',NULL,'J C P','76080159PG','25','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=98188',179,'Army'),
