 (32749,32752,'Unknown','BAREND CORNELIUS','ROUX','Sergeant',492,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'53 Battalion',1331,'1979-08-15','Killed in action, while on patrol near Ondangwa','***May have been from Rhodesia. ref. "Rhodesian Roll of Honour" by P. Geldenhuys (Roll compiled by Dr. J. R. T. Wood). Amendments from "Rhodesian Combined Forces Roll of Honour 1966-1981", by Adrian Haggett and Gerry van Tonder.','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'B C','69216158BT','26','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=517592',179,'Army'),
