 (32846,32849,'Unknown','GREGORY','SCOTT','Trooper',581,'South African Armoured Corps',779,'2 Special Service Battalion',655,'1988-06-27','Killed in action, during an air attack by MIG 23s on the Calueque dam (50km North of SWA border, Angola). His Eland armoured car was hit by a parachute retarded bomb, killing all 3 crew members. A Buffel was also hit, killing  8 soldiers from 8 SAI.','Son of Mrs. V. Scott, of Hillcrest, Kwazulu Natal','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Cremation Niche, Hillcrest Anglican Church GoR, Kwazulu Natal',NULL,'G','84246024BG','20','Gauteng',1,'LG Sup 13 December 1945',179,'Army'),
