 (32986,32989,'Unknown','FLORENCE CORNELIUS','SMIT','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'1 South African Infantry Battalion',114,'1981-08-24','Killed in action, during the attack on "target yankee" during Ops Protea. He was rifleman 4 of Bravo section, platoon 1. He was part of the assault group and was busy with guard duties when a booby trap exploded above his head. It was not known whether it was electrically detonated or set off by a Ratel. He was evacuated by the Bravo section vehicle','Son of Mr. and Mrs. W. C. Smit','South Africa',72,'MIDDELBURG (WEST) CEMETERY',1666,'-25.764','29.44846 ','1',NULL,'F C','80200249BG','18','Mpumalanga',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=95755',179,'Army'),
