 (32989,32992,'Unknown','GIDEON JOHANNES','SMIT','Trooper',581,'South African Armoured Corps',779,'1 Special Service Battalion',116,'1978-08-23','Killed in action, during the early hours of the morning when the bungalow in which they were sleeping at Katima Mulilo received a direct hit from a Soviet GRAD-P 122mm High Explosive Katyusha Rocket. SWAPO/PLAN insurgents operating from Zambia fired 20 x 122mm GRAD-P Katyusha Rockets into the town. 18 rockets exploded harmlessly in the veld, one struck a school in the Katima Mulilo Township and the other demolished the Bungalow in which the soldiers were sleeping','Of Roodepoort','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'May be buried in West park or Krugersdorp cem. Panel 06',NULL,'G J','75560086BG','25','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=95755',179,'Army'),
