 (32999,33002,'Unknown','WILLEM HENDRIK','SMIT','Lance Corporal',311,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'2 South African Infantry Battalion',654,'1980-08-30','Killed in action, while searching a Kraal in Northern Owamboland. The patrol entered a Kraal during a search for suspected insurgents while he remained on the Buffel Troop Carrier acting as the Gunner. An insurgent that was hiding in one of the huts fired an RPG-7 at the vehicle and the PG-7 Anti-Tank Rocket exploded at the position where he was standing, killing him instantly.','Son of Mr. W. H. Smit, of General De Wet, Bloemfontein.','South Africa',72,'BLOEMFONTEIN (IN MEMORIAM) CEMETERY',280,'-29.14566','26.20732 ','Grave 1054',NULL,'W H','76320795BG','20','Free State',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=95755',626,'attd. 61 Mechanised Battalion Group'),
