 (33040,33044,'Unknown','PONCIANO GOMES SILVA','SOEIRO','Sergeant',492,'1 Reconnaissance Regiment',9,'9 South African Infantry Battalion',1680,'1976-08-23','During a patrol near the Okavango river, a Wolf hit a landmine and was tipped over, killing Sgt P.G. Soeiro and crushing S/Sgt D. Roxo beneath it. The rest of the crew tried to lift it free, but it was too heavy, and he too subsequently died.','No additional information known at this time','South Africa',72,'THABA TSHWANE (NEW) MILITARY CEMETERY',2490,'-25.78214','28.12179 ','Grave 898',NULL,'P G S','75014431PN','18','Gauteng',1,'Unknown',118,'Air Force'),
