 (33056,33060,'Unknown','SHAUN ANTHONY','SPROWSON','Private',429,'South African Ordnance Services Corps',835,'16 Maintenance Unit',412,'1986-09-07','Died in military vehicle accident. While transporting ammunition from Grootfontein to Rundu, the vehicle he was driving left the road and overturned, killing him.','Nephew of Mr. R. A. Sprowson, of Newcastle.','South Africa',72,'NEWCASTLE CEMETERY',1796,'-27.75721','29.94408 ','Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'S A','85224475BG','20','Kwazulu Natal',1,'Unknown',179,'Army'),
