 (33148,33152,'Unknown','KAREL CHRISTIAAN','STRYDOM','Corporal',166,'South African Commandos',791,'Klein Karoo Commando',2500,'1977-10-17','Died in Shooting Incident, at Nkurenkuru, while on patrol. Although orders had been given that nobody leaves the area where the patrol was camped without notifying the sentries, he moved out of the area and when he returned he was shot in the stomach by the sentry who mistook him for a intruder. He died before medical help arrived','Husband of Mrs. M. S. Strydom, of Gammakloof, Willowmore.','South Africa',72,'WILLOWMORE CEMETERY',2729,'-33.29422','23.48483 ','HA13',NULL,'K C','68986223KT','33','Eastern Cape',1,'DFC LG 15 February 1946 pg. 962 - "In recognition of gallantry and devotion to duty in the execution of air operations"; MID LG Sup 1 January 1946 pg. 129',179,'Army'),
