 (33524,33528,'Unknown','MICHAEL JOHAN','VAN HEERDEN','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'8 South African Infantry Battalion',1628,'1988-06-27','Killed in action, during an air attack by MIG 23s on the Calueque dam (50km North of SWA border, Angola). His Eland armoured car was hit by a parachute retarded bomb, killing all 3 crew members. A Buffel was also hit, killing 8 soldiers from 8 SAI.','Son of Mr. and Mrs. F. A. van Heerden','South Africa',72,'VIRGINIA CEMETERY',2635,'-28.11082','26.8493 ','A1',NULL,'M J','84382407BG','20','Free State',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=95291',20,'"D" Coy. Oudtshoom'),
