 (33529,33533,'Unknown','MAARTIN JACOBUS','VAN JAARSVELD','Corporal',166,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'1 South African Infantry Battalion',114,'1982-04-15','Whilst on patrol the Lt sent out a section (1 Ratel) to follow a couple a tracks that the tracker had picked up. The Ratel hit an ambush just after 10am. By the time backup had formed up and went to their aid a group of soldiers had been killed.','Son of Mr. and Mrs. Van Jaarsveld','South Africa',72,'COLENSO CEMETERY',562,'-28.73443','29.81999 ','A1 - New cemetery',NULL,'M J','77554202PF','20','Kwazulu Natal',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=95291',20,'"D" Coy. Oudtshoom'),
