 (33531,33535,'Unknown','TIAN','VAN JAARSVELD','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'8 South African Infantry Battalion',1628,'1983-10-17','Died of wounds, received accidentally, at Okalongo.','The platoon that Van Jaarsveld was a member of were busy checking their kit just outside the base as they were heading out on a patrol. An RPG 7 rocket carried by another soldier misfired and hit Van Jaarsveld. He did not die immediately. He was flown to the RSA and died a few days later.','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'T','80400344BG','30','Gauteng',10,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor86.asp?t=95291',10,'"B" Coy.'),
