 (33565,33569,'Unknown','JOHANNES PETRUS','VAN RENSBURG','Private',429,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'Regiment De la Rey',2806,'1987-09-26','Died in Military Vehicle Accident, near Mooi Plaas in the Kruger National Park. He was busy with a compulsory camp and crashed the vehicle at night, on a unauthorized trip','Husband of Mrs. S. van Rensburg, of Krugersdorp.','South Africa',72,'KRUGERSDORP (STERKFONTEIN) CEMETERY',1379,'-26.06757','27.76241 ','Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'J P','75523522','28','Gauteng',1,'"At Ogongo Agricultural College in Ovamboland, a labourer went down into a sewage pit to clean it. His supervisor, Mr. Brown heard him fall into the water and climbed down to help him. Three Medical Service National Servicemen were in the area and tried to save them. None of them returned as all were overcome by fumes. The three, Ptes FJ Smith, JC Jooste and B van D van Papendorp were awarded Honoris Crux medals"',179,'Army'),
