 (33633,33637,'Unknown','STONEY','VAN WYK','Rifleman',462,'South African Infantry Corps',808,'Cape Regiment',2015,'1990-04-15','Died in Shooting Incident. Shot during riot while on patrol in Mpumulanga','Next of kin, Guardian Mrs. K. Davis','South Africa',72,'WELLINGTON CEMETERY, Western Cape',2698,'-33.65164','19.00075 ','A2',NULL,'S','88064423BW','24','Western Cape',1,'He distinguished himself as part of Bravo Group during Op Savannah',179,'Army'),
 (33634,33638,'Unknown','WYNAND ALBERT','VAN WYK','Lance Corporal',311,'South African Armoured Corps',779,'2 Special Service Battalion',655,'1988-06-27','Killed in action, during an air attack by MIG 23s on the Calueque dam (50km North of SWA border, Angola). His Eland armoured car was hit by a parachute retarded bomb, killing all 3 crew members. A Buffel was also hit, killing 8 soldiers from 8 SAI.','Son of Mr. H. P. van Wyk, of Roodepoort.','South Africa',72,'PANORAMA CEMETERY',1917,NULL,NULL,'A2',NULL,'W A','84450683BG','19','Gauteng',1,'He distinguished himself as part of Bravo Group during Op Savannah',179,'Army'),
