 (33769,33773,'Unknown','BAREND JACOBUS','VORSTER','Captain',115,'South African Air Force',775,'8 Sqdn.',1629,'1987-07-20','Died in aircraft accident, when his Atlas MB326M Impala Mk I, Serial No. 464 crashed into the sea off Durban during a training exercise with the South African Navy. His rear-seater, Captain Renier Pienaar ejected successfully and was rescued from the sea by the Navy.','Son of Mr. and Mrs. A. J. Vorster. ref. 85 years of SAAF','South Africa',72,'THABA TSHWANE (NEW) MILITARY CEMETERY',2490,'-25.78214','28.12179 ','C1-17 Crem. Niche',NULL,'B J','79468609PS','24','Gauteng',1,'He distinguished himself as part of Bravo Group during Op Savannah',118,'Air Force'),
