 (33789,33793,'Unknown','STEFANUS SEBASTIAN','WALTERS','Colonel',143,'South African Air Force',775,'Military Intelligence, Pretoria',2600,'1983-05-28','Died of injuries received in a car bomb attack on SAAF HQ in Pretoria, 17 killed 197 injured','Husband of Mrs. S. L. Walters, of Pretoria.','South Africa',72,'CENTURION CEMETERY',499,NULL,NULL,'Block E, Grave 917',NULL,'S S','81541765PE','43','Gauteng',1,'He distinguished himself as part of Bravo Group during Op Savannah',118,'Air Force'),
