 (33860,33864,'Unknown','PETER NOEL (TIFFY)','WIGGELL','Corporal',166,'South African Technical Services Corps',863,'Regiment Algoa Bay',2802,'1977-07-05','Killed in action, during a contact with SWAPO insurgents while attached to Bravo Company Regiment Algoabaai','Whilst attached to Bravo Company Regiment Algoabaai. It was during this period that one evening, his unit came under sustained mortar and machine gun fire. Corporal Tim Conway was fatally wounded by shrapnel during the opening engagement. With total disregard for his personal safety, "Tiffy" returned fire from an exposed position and simultaneously directed return mortar fire. For this, "Tiffy" was awarded the Honoris Crux. He was sadly killed in action, the following year.','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'P N','67314088BT','25','Gauteng',1,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=96892',62,'1st Bn.'),
 (33861,33865,'Unknown','WILLIAM THOMAS','WIGGELL','Sapper',469,'South African Corps of Engineers',793,'2 Field Engineer Regiment',624,'1977-07-05','Died in Military Vehicle Accident, at Bethlehem','Whilst attached to Bravo Company Regiment Algoabaai. It was during this period that one evening, his unit came under sustained mortar and machine gun fire. Corporal Tim Conway was fatally wounded by shrapnel during the opening engagement. With total disregard for his personal safety, "Tiffy" returned fire from an exposed position and simultaneously directed return mortar fire. For this, "Tiffy" was awarded the Honoris Crux. He was sadly killed in action, the following year.','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'W T','75524363BG','20','Gauteng',179,'http://www.izkor.gov.il/izkor82.asp?t=96892',179,'Army'),
