 (35623,35628,'Unknown','ERIC B','MAKALANE','Sergeant',492,'South African Police',840,'Tarkastad Eastern Cape',3137,'2003-11-22','Following information regarding a man suspected of housebreaking. Makhalane apparently followed the man to where he stayed and went inside the house. He started questioning the man about the housebreaking when the man allegedly drew a knife and stabbed Makhalane in the chest. He fell to the floor and died on the way to the hospital.','ref. Gallantry Awards of the South African Police 1913-1994','South Africa',72,'SOUTH AFRICAN POLICE MEMORIAL, PRETORIA (UNION BUILDINGS)',2317,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'E B','919620-0','41','Gauteng',548,'LG Sup 22 August 1918 as 133 Battery Sergeant Major 12th Citizen Battery',548,'Police'),
