 (38012,38018,'Unknown','HERMANUS THEODORIS STEYN','VAN EEDEN','Captain',115,'South African Police',840,'Middleburg, Cape Province',2597,'1971-10-05','Killed in action, by anti personnel mine in Caprivi Strip, while on COIN duty in South West Africa. He was investigating a mine blast that had occurred the previous day, near Katima Mulilo, which had injured 4 policemen.','ref. Gallantry Awards of the South African Police 1913-1994 and "The Silent War" by Peter Stiff','South Africa',72,'DURBAN (STELLAWOOD) CEMETERY',729,'-29.88587','30.97733 ','Police Plot',NULL,'H T S','34560','39','Kwazulu Natal',1,'Unknown',548,'Police'),
 (38013,38019,'Unknown','HERMANUS THEODORIS STEYN','VAN GREUNING','Sergeant',492,'South African Police',840,'Middleburg, Cape Province',2597,'1991-04-20','Killed in action, by anti personnel mine in Caprivi Strip, while on COIN duty in South West Africa. He was investigating a mine blast that had occurred the previous day, near Katima Mulilo, which had injured 4 policemen.','ref. Gallantry Awards of the South African Police 1913-1994','South Africa',72,'SOUTH AFRICAN POLICE MEMORIAL, PRETORIA (UNION BUILDINGS)',2317,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'B J','0417530-1','39','Gauteng',548,'Unknown',548,'Police'),
 (38014,38020,'Unknown','BLACKS','VAN HEERDEN','Police Dog',420,'South African Police',840,'Middleburg, Cape Province',2597,'2006-06-25','Killed in Jeppestown when ambushed by 22 well armed robbers (subsequently 8 Killed /14 Arrested ) who had robbed the PICK AND PAY Honeydew. One of the robbers was wounded when trying to escape and he lead the police to the house in Jeppie where a shoot out occurred','ref. SAPS Roll of Honour','South Africa',72,'KRUGERSDORP (STERKFONTEIN) CEMETERY',1379,'-26.06757','27.76241 ','Remembered on same headstone as his handler',NULL,'B','0417530-1','39','Gauteng',1,'Unknown',548,'Police'),
 (38015,38021,'Unknown','BAREND MATTHYS','VAN HEERDEN','Captain',115,'South African Police',840,'Middleburg, Cape Province',2597,'1946-12-30','Shot by murder suspect Piet Matthyse while tracking him near Van Wyksdorp','Husband of Fransina Johanna Hendrina van Heerden, of Oudtshoorn. Born Sterkstroom, Cape Province. ref. Gallantry Awards of the South African Police 1913-1994','South Africa',72,'R327 ROADSIDE GRAVE, VAN WYKSDORP AREA',2934,NULL,NULL,'Remembered on same headstone as his handler',NULL,'B M','11754','41','Western Cape',1,'Unknown',548,'Police'),
 (38016,38022,'Unknown','BAREND MATTHYS','JACOB','Rifleman',462,'South West African Territory Force',877,'101 Battalion, Romeo Mike Team',157,'1987-01-08','Killed in action. Eleven members from 101 Battalion SWATF and the 101 Battalion Romeo Mike Teams with attached personnel, were killed in action and 65 wounded during a contact with a numerically superior enemy force near Vinticet in Southern Angola. During the contact, some of the Romeo Mike Casspir vehicles burnt out after being knocked out by concentrated fire from Soviet RPG-7 Anti-Tank Rockets and Yugoslavian M60 HEAT STRIM and M60P Pencil STRIM rifle grenades','From 904SCC-RM7','South Africa',72,'SADF WALL OF REMEMBRANCE, VOORTREKKER MONUMENT, PRETORIA',2234,NULL,NULL,'Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'S','11754','25','Gauteng',1,'Unknown',548,'Police'),
 (38017,38023,'Unknown','DANIEL JOACHIM','VAN HEERDEN','1st Class Constable',6,'South African Police',840,'Umtata, Transkei Division',3172,'1922-03-11','Killed in action, during Rand Revolt','Son of Daniel Joachim and Susanna Sophia (nee Kruger) van Heerden. On SAP Memorial','South Africa',72,'BOKSBURG CEMETERY',295,'-26.21977','28.27423 ','Alternative Commemoration until grave found',NULL,'D J','9221','22','Gauteng',1,'Unknown',548,'Police'),
 (38018,38024,'Unknown','FREDERIK ANDRIES JACOBUS (FRIKKIE)','VAN HEERDEN','Inspector',291,'South African Police',840,'Umtata, Transkei Division',3172,'2006-06-25','Killed in Jeppestown when ambushed by 22 well armed robbers (subsequently 8 Killed /14 Arrested ) who had robbed the PICK AND PAY Honeydew. One of the robbers was wounded when trying to escape and he lead the police to the house in Jeppie where a shoot out occurred','Son of Frederik Andries Jacobus and Helena Elizabeth (nee Nel) van Heerden. Husband of Leonie (nee Mynhardt) van Heerden. ref. SAPS Roll of Honour','South Africa',72,'KRUGERSDORP (STERKFONTEIN) CEMETERY',1379,'-26.06757','27.76241 ','His K-9 dog is remembered on his headstone',NULL,'F A J','448656-1','32','Gauteng',1,'Unknown',548,'Police'),
