 (38924,38930,'Unknown','HERBERT FRANCIS','BELSTEAD','Sergeant',492,'Rhodesian Air Force',614,'7 Sqdn.',1530,'1976-09-01','Killed in action, by ground fire during air ops in Alouette III #R7524 at Matabi 2 Tribal Trust Land, Inyanga area.','ref. "Rhodesian Roll of Honour" by P. Geldenhuys (Roll compiled by Dr. J. R. T. Wood). Amendments from "Rhodesian Combined Forces Roll of Honour 1966-1981", by Adrian Haggett and Gerry van Tonder.','Zimbabwe',95,'HARARE (WARREN HILLS) CREMATORIUM',1063,NULL,NULL,'Cremated',NULL,'H F','5972','27','Harare (Salisbury)',1,'***Not yet accepted for War Grave Status by CWGC, need service file',656,'3 Commando'),
