 (39165,39171,'Unknown','JOHN GIBBS','CREWE','Rifleman',462,'Rhodesia Regiment',610,'5 Independent Company',1288,'1976-06-15','Died of wounds, gunshot wounds, received in a contact at Nagaone Business Centre near Chipinga, Op Thrasher. Three CTs were encountered at a school; two were killed but, a third took cover in the bush from where he shot and killed Mark Torrington and John Crewe. A third rifleman was seriously wounded.','ref. "Rhodesian Roll of Honour" by P. Geldenhuys (Roll compiled by Dr. J. R. T. Wood). Amendments from "Rhodesian Combined Forces Roll of Honour 1966-1981", by Adrian Haggett and Gerry van Tonder.','Zimbabwe',95,'BULAWAYO (ATHLONE) CEMETERY',384,'-20.12167','28.59161 ','Cremated at Warren Hills',NULL,'J G','PR104449','19','Bulawayo',1,'***Not yet accepted for War Grave Status by CWGC, need service file',639,'Mortar Troop'),
