 (40132,40138,'Unknown','NYIKA','MUCHAZOREGA','Private',429,'Rhodesian African Rifles',613,'1st Battalion',524,'1967-09-14','Died of wounds, gunshot wounds, at Intundhla Siding, Lupane District, Op Nickel. Elements of 10 Platoon under Lt Noble were following the tracks of 5 CTs since early on the morning of 05 September. Contact was made 20 miles south west of Intundhla Siding at 1300 when a CT was killed and another wounded. The wounded man threw a grenade, killing Nyika and wounding Pte Pedzisayi','ref. "Rhodesian African Rifles Roll of Honour" by Adrian Haggett and Gerry van Tonder.','Zimbabwe',95,'UNKNOWN CEMETERY',2572,NULL,NULL,'NYAHUNDA PURCHASE AREA CEMETERY, BIKITA DISTRICT',NULL,'N','R42580','36','Bikita District',19,'***Not yet accepted for War Grave Status by CWGC, need service file',19,'"D" Coy.'),
