 (40429,40435,'Unknown','MURIRA','TAVUGARA','Temp Corporal',570,'Rhodesian African Rifles',613,'2nd Battalion',898,'1976-06-04','Died of wounds, shrapnel wounds received in the Honde Valley. The stick was based at the DC camp near Pungwe and was resting at a store close by when terrorists initiated an attack with an RPG 2 rocket. The explosion fatally wounded Murira and blinded Sgt Hofisi.','ref. "Rhodesian African Rifles Roll of Honour" by Adrian Haggett and Gerry van Tonder.','Zimbabwe',95,'GUTU DISTRICT AREA CEMETERY',1028,NULL,NULL,'Buried North of Bikita, in the Eastern part of Gutu.',NULL,'M','644722','23','Gutu District',15,'***Accepted by CWGC for War Grave Status & burial site under investigation',15,'"C" Coy.'),
