 (40479,40485,'Unknown','WILFRED SOUTHEY DEARE','OLDMAN','Captain',115,'Royal Berkshire Regiment',649,'8th Bn.',1665,'1915-09-25','Killed in action, first day of the Battle of Loos','Son of Arthur Richard and Helen Annette Oldman. Born Surrey, England. Orphaned at the age of eight. Had been living in South Africa when war broke out.','France',27,'BOIS-CARRE MILITARY CEMETERY, HAISNES',2958,NULL,NULL,'A. 31.',NULL,'W S D','112123','36','Pas de Calais',1,'For actions or awarded 4 September 1979',6,'"A" Coy.'),
