 (40494,40500,'Unknown','JOHN STEPHEN','UNDERWOOD','Tech / Sergeant',567,'Rhodesian Air Force',614,'4 Sqdn.',1151,'1977-09-02','Died in Military Aircraft  Accident, in Lynx F337 #R3042 which flew into the ground 20 miles south of Umtali during a cross border raid, as a result of target fixation by the pilot.','Born July 1951. ref. "Pride of Eagles" - History of the Rhodesian Air Force 1920 - 1980 by B. Salt. ref. "Rhodesian Roll of Honour" by P. Geldenhuys (Roll compiled by Dr. J. R. T. Wood). Amendments from "Rhodesian Combined Forces Roll of Honour 1966-1981", by Adrian Haggett and Gerry van Tonder.','Zimbabwe',95,'UNKNOWN CEMETERY',2572,NULL,NULL,'NARROWVALE AREA CEMETERY',NULL,'J S','6110','26','Eastern Cape',1,'***Submitted for War Grave Status to CWGC, awaiting acceptance',635,'1 Commando'),
